// lexdb over TDS, the fixes of the Java client pass (design/lexdb-tds.md, "Java client pass"): the catalog procedures
// mssql-jdbc calls for DatabaseMetaData (sp_tables, sp_columns_170, sp_pkeys, sp_fkeys, sp_statistics_100,
// sp_special_columns_100, sp_stored_procedures, sp_table_privileges, sp_column_privileges) with their rows collected in
// table variables, a batch that begins with a system procedure's name, the BEGIN TRAN IF ... of Connection.setSavepoint,
// CONVERT of a bit to an integer type, SET ROWCOUNT, MERGE's rows, and SQL Server's own words for errors 156, 102 and 208.
// Their answers are SQL Server 2022's (the Md.java run recorded in design/lexdb-tds.md). The wire's own changes
// (a decimal parameter's length, MERGE's DONE command) are checked by tests/lexdb/java/MssqlJdbc.java.
